CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'connector->connector_type == DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_DVID'
#57: FILE: drivers/gpu/drm/radeon/radeon_connectors.c:963:
+	if ((connector->connector_type == DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_DVID) ||
+	    (connector->connector_type == DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_HDMIA))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

